! THE PAGE.  52 lines, all located, contiguous from 230262.40 to
! 230316.40 (a half word; next location 230317.00), then blank paper.
! printed p.253 (PDF p.4) ends with a half word at 230262.00
! (BXE,RECDMP), so line 1's .40 continues it; printed p.255 (PDF p.6,
! heading LOCATION 230317) opens at 230317.00.  No remarks.  Asterisks
! after the LOCATION on lines 4, 27 and 47.
!
! GLYPHS SETTLED BY OTHER THAN PLAIN INK:
