!     VF,DCHEX (D printed with a worn stem): landed p.104 D BSFL = 7.0,
!     D CHEX = 12.0; the VFs print 000007.00+ and 000014.00+.
!   * line 7 label "RECOBL" = REDOBL (worn D): the spelling landed
!     decks already use (REDOBL SYN, (8)230265.40 = this row).
!   * line 52 label "RESTCR" = RESTOR (open O): landed decks' RESTOR
!     SYN at 230316.40 = this row.
!   * line 23 "LV,$15,C($13)" = 0($13): prints 000000.36 3D, the same
!     word as line 44's LV,$15,($13).
!   * line 22 "LV,VU,.32($13)" is written as printed (no leading 0;
!     point notation): prints 000000.46 3D as lines 7, 15, 39, 52.
!   * line 34 "$+3.C" = $+3.0; line 50 "CM0C00" = CM0000 (a CM mnemonic
!     carries only binary digits).
!   * hex bytes / octal fields with an open round glyph are 0
!     ("CCC007.00+", "CCCC00.46" etc.); "C8" line 6, "C1" line 42,
!     "0C" line 31, "EC" line 30 as the assembler prints them.
!
